  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w04.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w04.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大会の朝の控室、砂と石鹸の匂い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "壁が薄くて、客席のざわめきが床から伝わる。膝が少し笑ってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳も、心なしか伏せ気味。……私の、だけど。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日は初心者大会。相手は普通のモンスター、操作に慣れるための大会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "目標は優勝、そして温泉。全員でそう決めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……決めたのは、主に私。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "差し入れに、八つ裂き大福を配った。初見の面々が三様の悲鳴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二口目で、全員黙った。控室の緊張が、赤いソースと一緒に切れた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "計測係くんが力量測定に来た。測るたび、記録板を持つ手が震える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三人目で、彼は板を裏返して抱きしめた。感想欄が見えた。「でかい」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あ、あの、計測器の上限って、超えていいものなんでしょうか」知りません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私が聞きたい。計測係くんは震える手で、上限の外に小さく点を打った。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "係員さんが、砂の外の一段高い席へ案内してくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「監督席です。監督は戦いません。声で指示を出します」声で。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "声だけで?「はい。よく通る監督が、強い監督です」私はこっそり、咳払いをした。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "監督席からは、砂場の全部が見えた。ここから三人の背中を見て、声を届かせる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——カジノのフロア長が、台の全部を見る立ち位置と同じだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そう思ったら、少しだけ膝が静かになった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "要項の申込人の欄に、経理課の判と桃色の付箋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「出場は節税です」うちの初陣、経理の都合で始まってた。壁の向こうでガヤ氏の前説。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「本日の注目は——新規のみなさん!」一拍、ためた言い直しだった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "整列の号令。うちの三人が並ぶと、相手側の列が三歩下がった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "主催の係員が小声で聞いてきた。「あの……本当に、初心者ですか」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "初心者です。監督が。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は名簿を胸に抱え直して、背筋を伸ばした。半年の接客で覚えた、いちばん堂々とした立ち方。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.direction.mimi.shift.012",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w04.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "客席から、ぱらぱらと拍手。最前列に、あの白ひげの剣士さんがいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "腰の剣は、今日は静か。観に来てくれたんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.012c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.012c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——四十人分の判子の、たぶん、お返しに。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w04.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "入場口の札が、係員の手で「出場」へ裏返る。ゲートの向こうで、光が待っている。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "main.s1.w04.choice.001",
          "label": "勝ちましょう、じゃなくて——温泉、行きましょう!",
          "result": "三人が、そろって噴き出した。緊張がいい方向へ切れる音。ガヤ氏が場内へ流す。「新規チーム、目標は温泉!」客席が沸いた。「温泉に単勝!」……何の単勝だ。笑ったまま、光の中へ入場した。",
          "intent": "気負いを笑いに変えて、送り出す",
          "promise": "チームの緊張が解ける代わりに、目標が場内放送で公表される",
          "memory": "ガヤ氏が「目標は温泉」を実況の持ちネタにする",
          "tone": "wild",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s1.w04.node.end.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "main.s1.w04.choice.002",
          "label": "全員で、無事に帰りましょう",
          "result": "派手な言葉より、それが一番効いた。三人が、順番に私を見た。「無事に、ね」と誰かが復唱する。入場は静かに始まった。……あとで実況に「王者の風格」と誤解されたけど、否定はしないでおく。",
          "intent": "勝敗より先に、全員が帰ることを約束する",
          "promise": "信頼の芯ができる代わりに、場内の期待値が勝手に上がる",
          "memory": "「無事に、ね」という復唱が、チームの合言葉になり始める",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s1.w04.node.end.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w04.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
